                                "example_id": "a4605eaf-fd5c-4fce-a35b-a998a024b68c",
                                "sense_id": "8dba8a0f-0e8b-3055-873e-9cf3aacbe499",
                                "text": "He reproached his wife with unwifely disobedience, and with the crime of turning her own offspring against his father, and the two but mocked him!"
                            },
